OL,3,GNEWSACouncil likely to seek further #8m
OL,4,Agovernment bailout
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of a city council has
OL,7,Fconfirmed the authority will likely be
OL,8,Fseeking millions of pounds in a
OL,9,Fgovernment bailout later this year.
OL,11,FPolitical leaders were briefed in a
OL,12,Fmeeting last week, in which a figure of
OL,13,F#8m was expected to be asked for. The
OL,14,Fcouncil received #15.5m of Exceptional
OL,15,FSupport Funding (EFL) from the Ministry
OL,16,Ffor Housing Communities and Local
OL,17,FGovernment (MHCLG) in February.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
