OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil likely to seek further #8m
OL,4,Agovernment bailout
OL,5,
OL,6,FJeremy Hilton, leader of Gloucester
OL,7,FCity Council confirmed the news but
OL,8,Fsaid he was "deeply disappointed"
OL,9,Fdetails of a confidential meeting had
OL,10,Fbeen leaked.
OL,12,FHe added the council faced "significant
OL,13,Fchallenges" in the coming months and
OL,14,Fneeded "shared commitment" of "working
OL,15,Ftogether".
